# xschemrc for opening (or netlisting, drawing) the CACE testbench templates outside CACE.
# CACE itself doesn't read this file: it netlists each substituted testbench with the PDK's
# xschemrc and adds the run folder (with a "primitive" copy of inverter.sym) to the search path.

# The project's xschemrc (PDK settings + ../../xschem, where inverter.sym is).
source [file dirname [file normalize [info script]]]/../../xschem/xschemrc

# This folder.
append XSCHEM_LIBRARY_PATH :[file dirname [file normalize [info script]]]
